; An `eval` line of a regular transaction is evaluated as it is read,
; as its synonym `expr` is, so the oracle refuses to value the journal
; (value-expression: an assignment there could define a name that a
; valuation calls) instead of comparing it.  C++ values it from the
; price as usual.

P 2024/06/01 AAPL $160

2024/01/02 Buy
    eval purchase_count = 1
    Assets:Broker    10 AAPL @ $150
    Assets:Cash

test bal -X $
                $100  Assets
               $1600    Broker
              $-1500    Cash
--------------------
                $100
end test
